        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Sagittarius — 2nd Technique, gained at level 6.</em></p><p>Sagittarius is the centaur Chiron — the teacher. This is his gift: the arrow that guides rather than kills.</p><p>The target is wreathed in golden light for 1 minute. It gains a +1 status bonus to attack rolls, its attacks deal an extra @Damage[1d6[force]] damage, and it gains a fly Speed of 20 feet.</p><p>Once during the duration, as a free action, the target may treat one attack roll or saving throw as though it had rolled a 10.</p><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The extra damage increases by 1d6. At 14th level the fly Speed equals the target's Speed.</p><p><em>On a day your constellation is Ascendant this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a Zenith, 8 levels higher.</em></p>"
        },
